  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring support to the Climate, Resilience, and Inclusion Team (British Embassy Kathmandu)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring support to the Climate, Resilience, and Inclusion Team. Providing support for climate reporting, annual reviews, streamlining reporting, and policy inputs. It will be a 2-person &#x2018;core team&#x2019; with occasional inputs from other IOD PARC colleagues (no external involvement envisaged at the moment). We will be sub-contracted through one of the Embassy&#x2019;s existing partners if all goes through as that is a lot easier for them compared to setting up a new contract The British Embassy Kathmandu has requested IOD PARC to set out a proposal for monitoring support to its Climate, Resilience, and Inclusion Team. This is not a continuation of the existing RMEL project but does build on the experience and tools developed by RMEL.</narrative>
  </description>
